<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Checkpoint downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Checkpoint downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Checkpoint Systems Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited company's announcement last Thursday calling off merger with Ultrak Inc and projecting that earnings and revenues for the first quarter and full year 1997 would not meet analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>-- has 12-month price target of $17 on the stock, which was off 1/8 at 10.</p>
</text>
